WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:47.950
Someone once said:

00:01:48.520 --> 00:01:53.150
There is a parrot whose eggs 
are fluffy, soft omelets...

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:55.990
The Omeleparrot!

00:02:01.400 --> 00:02:03.970
There is a lake in which live

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:08.700
all manner of creatures busting 
with the best bean-jam,

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:13.840
from goldfish taiyaki and dorayaki, 
to mona shell wafers....

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:16.610
Lake Bean-Paste!

00:02:17.640 --> 00:02:19.980
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.820
An age in which people quest for 
yet-unknown culinary delights!

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
Wu Jungle

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
North Wool Continent

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
Toriko's House

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
No. 8 Biotope

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
World Kitchen

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
Cavern Lagoon

00:02:25.650 --> 00:02:26.990
No. 1 Biotope

00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:33.160
Toriko came to the Wu Jungle to 
get BB Corn for Terry to eat.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:36.130
5-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:43.000
He successfully captured the BB Corn!

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:49.340
At the same time, Komatsu 
took on a job from the IGO

00:02:49.340 --> 00:02:53.310
to create a dish from the ultimate 
fatty tuna, Bubbly Tuna,

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:57.150
in order to change the mind of the lone 
dissenter of the Gourmet Summit Resolution,

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.650
President Dohem of the Roto Republic.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:04.560
In order to create a sauce 
that matched the Bubbly Tuna,

00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.990
Komatsu managed to capture an ingredient 
for it, the Woolstar Sauce fruit.

00:03:10.230 --> 00:03:16.170
Komatsu met Toriko when he was on his 
way to the volcano to pop the corn,

00:03:16.170 --> 00:03:20.410
but to prepare the dish for the 
summit, he left the Wu Jungle behind.

00:03:22.440 --> 00:03:26.080
Toriko made popcorn from the BB Corn.

00:03:28.950 --> 00:03:30.210
There we go!

00:03:35.250 --> 00:03:36.990
Terry tasted it...

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:40.290
Okay, I'm going to eat it, too!

00:03:44.760 --> 00:03:46.130
Delicious!

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:49.270
Each bite makes the flavor grow and deepen!

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:52.740
The fluffy texture goes 
down my throat with ease!

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:58.640
The Hors d'oeuvre on my Full 
Course Menu will be BB Corn!

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:04.250
And then, a mysterious man appeared!

00:04:06.350 --> 00:04:11.550
The Gourmet Corp. Assassin! The 
Moment Toriko's Techniques Evolve!

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.930
Can I suck up that dog, too?

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:29.810
Knife!

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:35.240
It won't cut!

00:04:40.850 --> 00:04:42.920
Who the hell are you?

00:04:43.290 --> 00:04:46.190
How dare you eat other people's food!

00:04:49.160 --> 00:04:51.830
You can have the popcorn back, Toriko...

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.240
Rechew, rechew!

00:05:10.510 --> 00:05:16.080
Food this delicious should 
be eaten again and again!

00:05:17.020 --> 00:05:18.550
What the hell is this guy?

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:20.490
BB Corn...

00:05:21.490 --> 00:05:24.790
I'll definitely give you 
the BB Corn back, Toriko.

00:05:24.790 --> 00:05:27.560
Right now my pet is going to get it.

00:05:28.730 --> 00:05:31.400
Unfortunately, it's got a 
terrible sense of direction...

00:05:31.400 --> 00:05:34.970
Yes, a terrible sense of direction.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:39.210
I think it'll be back any time now, though.

00:05:51.180 --> 00:05:53.990
Isn't this a great straw?

00:05:54.490 --> 00:05:59.130
It's a straw made from the mouth 
of a giant Devil Mosquito!

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.800
Its flexibility and durability 
are incredible, to be sure,

00:06:03.800 --> 00:06:07.500
but I really thought you might 
have cut it there, Toriko.

00:06:07.500 --> 00:06:10.340
So <i>that</i>'s your Knife...

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:15.240
I suppose that's why Starjun 
has respect for it...

00:06:16.280 --> 00:06:17.410
Starjun?

00:06:21.710 --> 00:06:24.850
Are you from the Gourmet Corp., you bastard?

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:30.320
Thanks to you, the capture of 
that Regal whatever failed.

00:06:30.320 --> 00:06:33.860
The Gourmet Corp.'s 6th Branch 
Ingredient Procurement Division

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:37.300
took all responsibility and barely 
escaped with their lives...

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:40.060
I hear that one new recruit was even killed.

00:06:40.060 --> 00:06:44.000
So I was ordered to collect the equipment.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:49.310
That broken GT Robot the 
new guy was piloting.

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.610
You went to the Garden?

00:06:51.610 --> 00:06:57.920
Yeah! It was so fun... My 
first time in an IGO Garden.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:07:01.690
So many ingredients I'd 
never laid eyes on before!

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:11.060
But I didn't think that <i>those</i> two 
would be waiting for me there...

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.840
To think it'd be <i>you</i> that came...

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:27.240
I'd thought that Star or 
Tommy would have shown up.

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:37.990
Bringing in the Department Chief 
and Vice President of of the IGO...

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.820
That's just being childish.

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:44.390
This'll be a pain. You can 
have that broken-down robot!

00:07:50.670 --> 00:07:53.170
Instead of collecting the robot,

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:57.540
I sucked down dry a bunch of 
the creatures on the island.

00:07:57.540 --> 00:08:00.580
But I couldn't go back to 
headquarters empty-handed.

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:04.750
So I thought of taking back some 
ingredient from Regal Isle,

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.650
or maybe BB Corn as a present for the boss.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:13.190
Gourmet Corp... What in 
the world are you after?

00:08:14.320 --> 00:08:15.590
That's a silly question.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:20.300
What we are after is the 
ingredient called GOD.

00:08:22.800 --> 00:08:23.900
GOD?!

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:25.770
Yeah...

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:29.540
The ingredient that sits on top 
of all others in this world...

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:33.140
The ingredient with the power to 
enslave each and every human... GOD!

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:37.910
It's said that the person 
who gets that ingredient

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.780
can rule and control the entire world!

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:43.680
I wonder what it might taste like?

00:08:51.790 --> 00:08:55.130
What's wrong? You've nearly completed 
the sauce you wished for...

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.460
But you seem down...

00:08:57.930 --> 00:09:04.200
I was told to save the summit... 
But will my cooking really help?

00:09:04.670 --> 00:09:07.270
Suddenly I'm not so sure...

00:09:10.780 --> 00:09:12.010
Hey, did you know?

00:09:12.580 --> 00:09:16.180
The legend of the ingredient, 
GOD, that ended the world war.

00:09:16.980 --> 00:09:18.990
Huh? What's that?

00:09:18.990 --> 00:09:22.050
It was a gigantic war that 
happened 500 years ago...

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:31.600
A great war that engulfed the entire 
world for more than a century...

00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:39.340
The cause wasn't race, religion, 
politics or economics...

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.810
It was a far more fundamental reason...

00:09:42.910 --> 00:09:44.440
It was a scramble to obtain food supply...

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:50.950
The war grew more and more, and some 
thought the end of the world was near...

00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:59.360
Then, the Gourmet Hunter known 
as the Gourmet God, Acacia,

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:02.760
appeared and presented 
a certain ingredient...

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:06.060
Please, taste this.

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:16.540
It was the legendary ingredient, GOD!

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:19.140
GOD...

00:10:19.140 --> 00:10:21.910
The final ingredient discovered

00:10:21.910 --> 00:10:27.350
by the legendary Gourmet Hunter 
Acacia at the end of his life,

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:29.950
which was said to eat and be master 
of all other ingredients...

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.920
Said to only become active 
once every few hundred years

00:10:33.920 --> 00:10:35.490
during a total eclipse of the sun...

00:10:36.090 --> 00:10:39.000
The ingredient that 
transcends all others, GOD!

00:10:41.930 --> 00:10:43.600
Acacia, having obtained GOD,

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.600
traveled around to all the 
countries of the world...

00:10:48.400 --> 00:10:53.140
He brought the kings and 
leaders of each country GOD.

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:59.280
And those powerful people were all 
so moved by its taste, they thought:

00:11:04.020 --> 00:11:05.920
"War is such a foolish thing!"

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.090
"I want to let everyone 
taste this ingredient!"

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.810
And, just like that, the thirst for 
vengeance around the world dried up...

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:29.740
Yes! The war that had continued 
for 100 years ended!

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:45.530
The 100-year-long war was ended by GOD, 
presented by the Gourmet Hunter Acacia.

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.460
It is said that the discovery of GOD

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:51.030
brought about the beginning 
of the Gourmet Age.

00:11:56.370 --> 00:12:00.670
The happiness and feelings you get 
when eating something delicious

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:02.910
are not for stealing from others.

00:12:03.610 --> 00:12:06.210
They are for sharing, and empathizing...

00:12:07.280 --> 00:12:10.880
The ingredient that brought 
peace to the world, GOD...

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:13.750
Now your name shall become one of legend,

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:17.090
and the curtain will surely rise 
on an era focused around food...

00:12:18.490 --> 00:12:24.230
GOD calls not just to humans, but 
to all ingredients of the world...

00:12:24.230 --> 00:12:26.430
Its power is like magic...

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.200
When one obtains GOD,

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:34.270
one can monopolize the ingredients 
of the entire world.

00:12:35.440 --> 00:12:41.180
Indeed, I should seal shut my Full 
Course, where GOD is the Main Dish...

00:12:42.680 --> 00:12:47.050
In hundreds of years, when 
there is another solar eclipse,

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:52.820
I shall pray that ones who have 
a sharing heart will obtain GOD.

00:12:55.630 --> 00:12:58.030
And that's the legend that's 
been passed down since long ago.

00:12:58.830 --> 00:13:01.270
Well, it's only a legend.

00:13:02.330 --> 00:13:05.300
But I believe it a whole heaping lot!

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:11.940
Gourmet Ingredients... Delicious 
food... They fill up the heart.

00:13:13.810 --> 00:13:17.520
Delicious food fills up the heart?

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:22.950
Yup! I meant that delicious 
food is the bringer of peace.

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:32.500
Hey, Toriko... Have you heard this rumor?

00:13:33.960 --> 00:13:37.900
I hear that there's a good 
chance the Gourmet Eclipse,

00:13:37.900 --> 00:13:43.810
the eclipse where GOD becomes active, 
will happen sometime this year.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:46.980
What?!

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:03.030
Well, it's not info that's 
commonly known yet...

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.200
But I heard that Gourmet Researchers

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:10.670
and well-known Gourmet Hunters 
have already started to act...

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:15.340
Among them are a number of powerful 
ones that had gone into retirement...

00:14:17.640 --> 00:14:21.980
Lately my boss's appetite has 
grown to unreal levels...

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:26.620
Perhaps that's a sign that 
the eclipse is coming soon...

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:30.820
Thanks to that, I'm in a real 
pickle when I make him food!

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.890
My cooking can't keep up!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:34.760
Do you understand?

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:38.430
The Gourmet Age took its first 
baby cries hundreds of years ago,

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:44.370
and now it's awakening to take 
its first full steps forward!

00:14:45.970 --> 00:14:49.970
The Gourmet Age will truly progress forward?

00:14:50.940 --> 00:14:54.480
It really is perfect for my Full Course!

00:14:56.180 --> 00:15:02.420
I've already decided that GOD will 
be my Full Course's Main Dish!

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.920
I wanna eat GOD!

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.390
Toriko...

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:18.200
If you are after GOD, then one 
day you and we will wage war...

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:23.640
That sounds like a pain. Maybe 
I'll just finish you off now.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:43.720
Terry! Move a lot farther away!

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:46.030
Go!!

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:53.130
Toriko... Can I suck up your organs?!

00:15:53.130 --> 00:15:54.770
You're one big damn mosquito!

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:56.670
I'll suck you up!

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:57.800
Bring it!

00:15:57.800 --> 00:16:00.340
You can suck up a real eye-opener!

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:05.440
10-Fold...

00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.980
Spiked Punch!

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:30.100
He blew out the air he sucked 
in and countered my punches!

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:36.470
Enough momentum to counter my Breath Bazooka?

00:16:36.470 --> 00:16:38.640
Now that's pretty dangerous there...

00:16:38.640 --> 00:16:44.650
If I had tried to suck up that punch, 
it would have broken my straw!

00:16:47.280 --> 00:16:49.620
I went and used a 10-Fold 
right off the bat...

00:16:50.390 --> 00:16:52.790
I can't use another Spiked 
Punch for a while...

00:16:56.590 --> 00:17:02.270
His power is just as high as 
Starjun's, or close to it...

00:17:02.270 --> 00:17:05.370
But I have no intention of losing!

00:17:07.300 --> 00:17:14.340
Toriko! Your weakness is 
your attack range, yes?

00:17:14.840 --> 00:17:19.720
All of your attacks are only 
effective at short range!

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:21.480
Isn't that so?

00:17:23.550 --> 00:17:25.620
Which means...

00:17:25.620 --> 00:17:28.620
I think I'll attack you from over here!

00:17:29.960 --> 00:17:33.460
Then I'll suck you up at my leisure later!

00:17:34.000 --> 00:17:35.030
Breath Gun!

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:41.400
Are you kidding me?

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.410
What incredible lung capacity!

00:17:44.110 --> 00:17:46.310
He can shoot his breath this distance?!

00:17:51.610 --> 00:17:53.850
Fly faster, Sunny-san!

00:17:54.950 --> 00:17:57.150
I'll make a dish that will fill up

00:17:57.150 --> 00:18:00.120
President Dohem of the 
Roto Republic's heart...

00:18:00.820 --> 00:18:05.690
So I have to make it for the 
peak flavor of the Bubbly Tuna!

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:09.760
Matsu, that feeling in 
your heart is beautiful.

00:18:11.070 --> 00:18:12.330
Beautiful, however...

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:16.500
We're surrounded.

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.710
W-W-What's this? What's with all the birds?

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:27.250
Well, they aren't attacking. 
They're running from something.

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:31.820
Will we make it for the peak flavor 
of the Bubbly Tuna at this speed?

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:35.660
The peak will be tomorrow at 7 PM.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:38.790
We have less than 27 hours...

00:18:40.290 --> 00:18:43.230
Plus, we're over capacity here...

00:18:44.860 --> 00:18:46.600
Will we make it, or not?

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:54.070
By the way... Aren't these 
Volcano Weathercocks?

00:18:54.640 --> 00:18:57.340
The Volcano Weathercocks 
live near the Wool Volcano

00:18:57.340 --> 00:18:59.980
and move along in the direction of the wind.

00:19:00.550 --> 00:19:03.980
I'd heard that they never move 
too far from the Volcano...

00:19:03.980 --> 00:19:05.450
What in the world...

00:19:06.750 --> 00:19:07.650
Toriko-san...

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:20.630
Each one doesn't have much destructive 
power, but they're all aimed precisely!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:24.540
I'll never win at this distance!

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.880
So you're not going to let me 
get close, no matter what?!

00:19:33.780 --> 00:19:35.910
Here I come!

00:19:45.220 --> 00:19:47.430
What... the heck...

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:54.100
It's not just my imagination... I 
don't feel so far away from him...

00:19:58.970 --> 00:20:04.810
I'll use my evolved Knife 
and Fork to their fullest!

00:20:05.640 --> 00:20:11.280
The fusion of the autophagy and the 
Jewel Meat inside the Regal Mammoth...

00:20:12.250 --> 00:20:17.150
It seems like they gave 
my cells a major level up!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:22.990
Check it out for yourself with 
those triple compound eyes!

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:27.100
Fork!

00:20:35.370 --> 00:20:39.140
Flying Fork... Maybe I'll call it that.

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:43.550
I might not be able to pierce 
through at this distance,

00:20:44.750 --> 00:20:46.220
but it'll reach!

00:20:47.850 --> 00:20:50.120
That's surprising...

00:20:51.020 --> 00:20:53.560
Throwing your fork?

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:56.990
Would you like another surprise?

00:20:58.730 --> 00:21:03.130
I think I could hack down a 
giant BB Corn, no problem!

00:21:03.630 --> 00:21:07.100
Flying Knife!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:15.110
That might just be enough 
to cut your outer skin,

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:23.920
but pretty soon, even at this 
distance, your life will be mine!

00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:39.130
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:45.370
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:46.140 --> 00:21:52.650
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:53.050 --> 00:21:57.580
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:22:02.690
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:02.690 --> 00:22:06.060
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:06.060 --> 00:22:10.530
on a journey with no end!

00:22:12.370 --> 00:22:15.500
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:15.500 --> 00:22:18.640
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:24.640
amid the waves of time.

00:22:27.550 --> 00:22:29.280
Gourmet News!

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:31.850
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:32.350 --> 00:22:35.820
What a scoop! It seems 
Gourmet TV has succeeded

00:22:35.820 --> 00:22:40.060
in filming the pinnacle of 
all Gourmet Ingredients, GOD!

00:22:40.060 --> 00:22:41.190
Take a look!

00:22:41.430 --> 00:22:42.490
GOD!

00:22:43.160 --> 00:22:45.060
Or wait... BAT?

00:22:46.260 --> 00:22:47.230
MITT?

